Pocket Studio Debian images

The Debian packages come from the signed trixie and trixie-security APT
repositories frozen at 2026-11-18 00:00 UTC. The installed binary and source
package names and versions are recorded in debian-packages.tsv in this directory.
Package copyright information lives in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.
Source package index: https://snapshot.debian.org/
Debian slim image: https://github.com/debuerreotype/docker-debian-artifacts

The AVF root disk derives from Google's unmodified Terminal/Ferrochrome v4
Debian 13 image. The Android plugin stages the new disk for a guest-side
installer, following the production installation flow documented by
nix-community. The installer verifies the source VM and atomically exchanges
the root disk file with a backup. The stock boot and guest services come from
the Google distribution.
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r4/
